# Java and Maven

- Target Java 21 (`maven.compiler.release` 21). Do not lower the language level.
- Format Java with Spotless Google Java Format. After meaningful Java edits, run `mvn -B spotless:apply` before finishing.
- After meaningful code or POM changes, verify with:
  - `mvn -B verify -DskipTests` (Enforcer, Error Prone compile, Spotless check)
  - `mvn -B test` (optionally `-Dkeycloak.version=<version>`)
- Keep module structure: root aggregator POM + `providers/<name>/` modules.
- Do not add Keycloak-version Maven profiles; override with `-Dkeycloak.version` only.
